'''Izabe Island''' (Japanese: '''イザベ島''' ''Izabe Island'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Hoenn]] [[region]]. It is a large island situated between [[Mossdeep City]] and [[Sootopolis City]]. It contains a wide variety of environments, from [[desert]]ed areas to snow-covered mountains. Its highest peak is known as the '''Square Top''', a cube-shaped rock formation on a mountain. {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} traveled across the island from ''[[AG103|A Cacturne for the Worse]]'' to ''[[AG109|Do I Hear a Ralts?]]''.

==In animation==
The annual [[Purika City]] {{pkmn|Contest}} took place in ''[[AG103|A Cacturne for the Worse]]''. where {{an|May}} met her new [[rival]] [[Harley]]. Despite Harley's underhanded tactics during the final round, May won her fourth [[Ribbon]].

[[Sigourney]] is the current sage of Izabe Island. In ''[[AG104|Claydol Big and Tall]]'', he explained "The Great Destruction", a catastrophic event caused by a {{pkmn2|giant}} {{p|Claydol}} that threatened the island over a thousand years ago. Claydol remains sealed inside a stone {{i|Poké Ball}} to avoid another catastrophic event.

While on Izabe Island, [[Brock's Lombre]] [[Evolution|evolved]] into a {{p|Ludicolo}}, {{Ash}} {{pkmn2|caught}} a {{AP|Snorunt}}, and [[Max]] befriended a {{p|Ralts}} that he promised to start his {{pkmn|journey}} with.

